# No premature closure

- Do not mark in-app bugs `resolved` without public reporter-facing comment and production evidence ([`docs/governance/EVIDENCE_CONTRACT.md`](../../docs/governance/EVIDENCE_CONTRACT.md)).
- CI green / issue close count / doc volume are not success.
- Do not claim Plan complete as shipped.
- Prefer [`docs/sop/AGENT_PREFLIGHT.md`](../../docs/sop/AGENT_PREFLIGHT.md) before writes.
